@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Registro de Asistencia de Estudiantes
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16

actor "Asistente de Transporte" as Assistant
participant Frontend
participant TripsController
participant TripStudentAttendanceHandler
participant TripStudentAttendanceRepository
database Database

Assistant -> Frontend : Consulta pasajeros del viaje
Frontend -> TripsController : GET /api/trips/{tripId}/passengers
TripsController -> TripStudentAttendanceHandler : GetTripPassengersQuery
TripStudentAttendanceHandler -> TripStudentAttendanceRepository : Obtener pasajeros por viaje
TripStudentAttendanceRepository -> Database : Consultar TripStudentAttendances
Database --> TripStudentAttendanceRepository : Estudiantes esperados
TripStudentAttendanceRepository --> TripStudentAttendanceHandler : Lista de pasajeros
TripStudentAttendanceHandler --> TripsController : TripStudentAttendanceDto[]
TripsController --> Frontend : 200 OK
Frontend --> Assistant : Mostrar estudiantes esperados

Assistant -> Frontend : Marca abordado, ausente o descendido
Frontend -> TripsController : PUT /api/trips/{tripId}/students/{studentId}/...
TripsController -> TripStudentAttendanceHandler : Command de asistencia
TripStudentAttendanceHandler -> TripStudentAttendanceRepository : Buscar asistencia
TripStudentAttendanceRepository -> Database : Consultar asistencia y viaje
Database --> TripStudentAttendanceRepository : Datos actuales
TripStudentAttendanceRepository --> TripStudentAttendanceHandler : Registro cargado
TripStudentAttendanceHandler -> TripStudentAttendanceHandler : Validar estado del viaje
TripStudentAttendanceHandler -> TripStudentAttendanceHandler : Actualizar estado de asistencia
TripStudentAttendanceHandler -> TripStudentAttendanceRepository : Guardar cambios
TripStudentAttendanceRepository -> Database : Actualizar registro
Database --> TripStudentAttendanceRepository : Confirmacion
TripStudentAttendanceRepository --> TripStudentAttendanceHandler : OK
TripStudentAttendanceHandler --> TripsController : OK
TripsController --> Frontend : 204 No Content
Frontend --> Assistant : Mostrar confirmacion
@enduml
